Template: ombra/vm-too-small
Type: error
Description: This virtual machine cannot run Ombra
 ${REASON}
 .
 Ombra needs a virtual disk of at least 24 GB (30 GB recommended) and at least 3 GB of memory (6 GB recommended). Nothing has been written to the disk.
 .
 Power off this virtual machine, change its disk or memory in the virtualization app, and start the installer again.
